  "bio": "Sasha O'Kharin, based in Saint Petersburg, Russia, is a highly skilled artist who specializes in the style of realism. With a staggering 255k followers on Instagram, O'Kharin's tattoos are renowned for their lifelike detail and craftsmanship. You can book an appointment by reaching out to the artist through his @blackouttattoocollective or @1rs.tattoo Instagram handles. Bear in mind that the level of his artistry is matched by his professional demeanor, always striving for the ultimate client satisfaction.\nPrice: $$$\nCurrent location: Saint Petersburg, Northwestern Federal District, Russia"
